  "description": "Turn an existing Unity game into multiplayer. Unity 6 and 2022.3, UDP/TCP/WebSocket, predicted 3D/2D physics, selected field/property sync, quantization, spatial visibility and lifecycle tools. Optional Web and Voice packages add self-hosted MMO services.",
