  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release two: existing-prefab setup, real Rigidbody2D, 3D/custom motors, configurable member synchronization, manual/adaptive quantization, spatial visibility, scene/lifecycle/ownership/pooling tools, WebSocket/WebGL gameplay and authenticated self-hosted relays. Optional Web/Voice modules add accounts, MMO chat, persistent Communities, linked servers, a monochrome website and Opus voice. Session protocol 3 requires matching upgraded players/servers. Unity 6 primary; 2022.3 compatibility. See ReleaseTwo.md for setup, dependencies and tested boundaries.",
